  "prefLabel": "Puc 2202.13 ISO-NE",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2202.13 “ISO-NE” means ISO New England, Inc., the entity serving as the regional transmission operator and which oversees the operation of New England's bulk electric power generation and transmission system and administers the regional wholesale markets for electric energy and other electricity products, or its successors.\n\nSource. #13457, eff 10-12-22",
